UID:JpmOK-dU7im1hkqGz9rcP
SUMMARY:The Guess Who in Concert at Smart Financial Centre
DTSTAMP:20260808T093130Z
DTSTART:20260808T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Smart Financial Centre welcomes The Guess Who to the Sugar Land
	 stage. \nThe Canadian rock band found their greatest success in the late 
	60s and early 70s\, under the leadership of singer/keyboardist Burton Cumm
	ings and guitarist Randy Bachman runiting on stage for the first time in 2
	3 years with hit songs including American Woman\, These Eyes\, No Sugar To
	night/New Mother Nature\, and No Time. \nAdmission\nTickets start at $35. 
	Order tickets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was spons
	ored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and mo
	re details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, busin
	ess\, or offer across all of our channels. \n\nhttps://365thingsinhouston.
	com/calendar/the-guess-who-in-concert-at-smart-financial-centre/\n\nFrom 3
	65 Things to Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/the-guess-who-in-concert-at-sma
	rt-financial-centre/
LOCATION:Smart Financial Centre at Sugar Land\, 18111 Lexington Blvd\, Suga
	r Land\, TX\, 77479\, United States
