BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston
 .com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/52nd-Annual-Houston-Shakespeare-Festival-T
 he-Comedy-of-Errors-at-Miller-Outdoor-Theatre.jpeg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston.com/wp-content/uploads
 /2026/07/52nd-Annual-Houston-Shakespeare-Festival-The-Comedy-of-Errors-at-
 Miller-Outdoor-Theatre.jpeg
UID:0qF9IbXDLfR9YsfMejc6i
SUMMARY:52nd Annual Houston Shakespeare Festival: The Comedy of Errors at M
	iller Outdoor Theatre
DTSTAMP:20260808T093130Z
DTSTART:20260808T201500Z
DESCRIPTION:Houston Shakespeare Festival\, the city’s annual summer theater
	 tradition\, celebrates its 52nd season with performances of both The Temp
	est and The Comedy of Errors on alternating nights at Miller Outdoor Theat
	re. \nShakespeare’s Comedy of Errors\nShakespeare’s riotous farce of mista
	ken identity\, The Comedy of Errors\, brings double trouble to the bustlin
	g port city of Ephesus when two sets of twins—separated at birth—unexpecte
	dly cross paths\, unleashing a whirlwind of mayhem and mirth. \nIn this fa
	st-paced comedy bursting with physical humor\, outrageous confusion\, and 
	joyful surprise\, husbands are mistaken for strangers\, servants are denie
	d their own names\, and no one can tell friend from foe. As misunderstandi
	ngs multiply and tempers flare\, the laughter never lets up. \nFinding You
	r Seat at Miller Outdoor Theatre\nAs always\, all seats at Miller are free
	\, but covered seating for popular evening shows usually requires a free a
	ssigned ticket reserved 24 hours in advance. \nLearn more about getting fr
	ee seated tickets at Miller. \nAdmission\nFree. Learn more or reserve a fr
	ee seated ticket. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the
	 event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details.
	  \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or o
	ffer across all of our channels.\n\nhttps://365thingsinhouston.com/calenda
	r/52nd-annual-houston-shakespeare-festival-the-comedy-of-errors-at-miller-
	outdoor-theatre-4/\n\nFrom 365 Things to Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/52nd-annual-houston-shakespeare
	-festival-the-comedy-of-errors-at-miller-outdoor-theatre-4/
LOCATION:Miller Outdoor Theatre\, 6000 Hermann Park Dr\, Houston\, TX\, 770
	30\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:365-things-houston
CATEGORIES:365 Things to Do in Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT1H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston
 .com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/DroneArt-Show-Harry-Potter-at-Constellatio
 n-Field-sorting-hat.jpg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston.com/wp-content/uploads
 /2026/05/DroneArt-Show-Harry-Potter-at-Constellation-Field-sorting-hat.jpg
UID:N1wB52NAXwuTW1ZyuY8An
SUMMARY:DroneArt Show: Harry Potter at Constellation Field
DTSTAMP:20260808T093130Z
DTSTART:20260808T210000Z
DESCRIPTION:DroneArt Show returns to Houston with an official Harry Potter 
	light show in the sky at Constellation Field in Sugar Land. The show promi
	ses to be an unforgettable open-air spectacle as 1\,200 illuminated drones
	 recreate favorite characters and beloved moments from the Harry Potter fi
	lms. \nAs night falls\, hundreds of synchronized illuminated drones take o
	ff and create shapes in the sky\, moving in time with John Williams’ movie
	 score played live in a 65-minute performance. \n\nInspired by the Wizardi
	ng World\, the show ensures every guest takes part in the experience with 
	exclusive LED wristbands. \n\n\n\nThe open air setting will have food and 
	drink for sale. Plus—whether you’re sorted into houses Gryffindor\, Huffle
	puff\, Ravenclaw or Slytherin—costumes and Wizarding World attire are high
	ly encouraged. \n\nAdmission\nTickets start at $48\; $28 for ages 3 to 11.
	 Order tickets or learn more.   This Featured Calendar Listing was sponsor
	ed by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more
	 details. Learn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\
	, or offer across all of our channels. \n\nhttps://365thingsinhouston.com/
	calendar/droneart-show-harry-potter-at-constellation-field-2/\n\nFrom 365 
	Things to Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/droneart-show-harry-potter-at-c
	onstellation-field-2/
LOCATION:Constellation Field\, 1 Stadium Dr\, Sugar Land\, TX\, 77498\, Uni
	ted States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:365-things-houston
CATEGORIES:365 Things to Do in Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT1H
END:VEVENT
