DESCRIPTION:Social Beer Garden HTX celebrates the release of their exclusiv
	e Buffalo Trace single barrel selection\, welcoming bourbon lovers and nov
	ices to enjoy a limited-release pour that can’t be found anywhere else. \n
	The barrel was selected exclusively for Social Beer Garden HTX\, so every 
	pour is a one-of-a-kind experience. \n\n\nMultiple food trucks will be on 
	site. \n\n\n\nAdmission\nNo cover. Learn more. \n\n \nThis Featured Calend
	ar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calenda
	r with images and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, 
